<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>I'm Scared I’ll Never Sleep Again</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">5 Seconds of Summer</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">EVERYONE'S A STAR! (Fully Evolved)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">519y2mj7Tjt88o76JGcZdQ</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.296" end="00:13.248">Wish you were taking off your clothes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.248" end="00:15.937">Laying in my hotel bed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.937" end="00:18.482">Sex and a smoke</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.482" end="00:21.138">Settle down the beat in my chest</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.138" end="00:22.638">Yeah, I wish you were but</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.566" end="00:24.066" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.641" end="00:25.490">I know that New York makes you sick</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.490" end="00:28.143">Too many people in this shit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.143" end="00:30.893">Streetlights are creeping through my shades</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.893" end="00:33.262">I wanna kiss your nineties face</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.262" end="00:34.762" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.312" end="00:34.812">Baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.266" end="00:35.961">Maybe tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.961" end="00:37.461">Waiting</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.951" end="00:38.451">For a phone call</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.290" end="00:39.790">On the east side</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.611" end="00:41.111">That was my fault</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.895" end="00:42.395">I was wishing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.362" end="00:43.862">Wasn't so drunk</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.739" end="00:45.239" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.339" end="00:49.691">Every bed is cold without your body in it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.691" end="00:54.497">Everywhere I go, my skin is crawling</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.497" end="00:58.242">What if I can't close my eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.242" end="01:02.610">Without you in my head?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.610" end="01:06.053">I'm scared I'll never sleep again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.053" end="01:07.553" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.103" end="01:07.603">Pink tears</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.917" end="01:08.417">Falling tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.092" end="01:09.677">Through the red blush</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.677" end="01:11.177">On the other side</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.989" end="01:12.489">I was thinking</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.208" end="01:13.708">This will never end</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.685" end="01:15.185">Now I'm screaming</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.971" end="01:16.471">Through a nightmare</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.339" end="01:17.839" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.298" end="01:19.965">I know that New York makes you sick</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.965" end="01:22.693">Too many people in this shit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.693" end="01:25.474">Streetlights are creeping through my shades</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.474" end="01:27.905">I wanna kiss your nineties face</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.905" end="01:29.405" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.955" end="01:33.304">Every bed is cold without your body in it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.304" end="01:38.107">Everywhere I go my skin is crawling</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.107" end="01:41.922">What if I can't close my eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.922" end="01:46.181">Without you in my head?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.181" end="01:52.762">I'm scared I'll never sleep again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.762" end="01:58.224">I'll never sleep again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.224" end="02:00.817">I'll never sleep again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.817" end="02:08.817" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.404" end="02:27.941">Every bed is cold without your body in it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.941" end="02:32.628">Everywhere I go my skin is crawling</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.628" end="02:36.424">What if I can't close my eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.424" end="02:40.763">Without you in my head?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.763" end="02:44.763">I'm scared I'll never sleep again</p></div></body></tt>